---
title: "One command for one step of a run"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks CompleteStaysVerified or NeverBlindRepeat or NoDeadlock or UncertainStaysBlocked
    lg1: Path to the CompleteStaysVerified or NeverBlindRepeat or NoDeadlock or UncertainStaysBlocked bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: first: Not sent / second: Not sent / step not started
  s1: first: Admitted: intent saved, handler not called / second: Not sent / step not started
  s2: first: On record as running, no worker left / second: Not sent / step not started
  s3: first: Result in hand, not recorded, handler was called / second: Not sent / step not started
  s4: first: Worker still going, its lease gone / second: Not sent / step not started
  s5: first: Stuck: on record as running, run cancelled / second: Not sent / step not started
  s6: first: Worker still going, its lease gone, handler was called / second: Not sent / step not started
  s7: first: Worker still going, its lease gone / second: Admitted: intent saved, handler not called / step not started
  s8: first: Recorded uncertain by its worker / second: Not sent / step uncertain
  s9: first: Worker still going, its lease gone, handler was called / second: Admitted: intent saved, handler not called / step not started
  s10: first: Worker still going, its lease gone / second: Result in hand, not recorded, handler was called / step not started
  s11: first: Worker still going, its lease gone, handler was called / second: Result in hand, not recorded, handler was called / step not started
  s12: first: Worker still going, its lease gone / second: Recorded complete / step complete and verified
  s13: first: Uncertain, but the step is open again / second: Not sent / step failed, open to a new command
  s14: first: Marked uncertain, reconciliation queued / second: Recorded complete, but the step no longer is / step uncertain
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a caller sends the command (first)
  s1 --> s2: the worker dies (first)
  s1 --> s3: the handler is called and returns (first)
  s1 --> s4: the lease runs out
  s2 --> s5: the run is cancelled
  s3 --> s6: the lease runs out
  s3 --> s8: the result is recorded as uncertain (first)
  s4 --> s7: a caller sends the command (second)
  s6 --> s9: a caller sends the command (second)
  s7 --> s10: the handler is called and returns (second)
  s8 --> s8: revalidation takes the lease
  s9 --> s11: the handler is called and returns (second)
  s10 --> s12: the result is recorded as complete (second)
  s8 --> s13: revalidation rejects an earlier step
  s12 --> s14: the same id is sent again: marked uncertain (first)
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 bugPath
